        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each fragile article is wrapped in 80‑GSM bubble wrap, cushioned with high‑density foam edge protectors, and placed inside custom‑cut wooden crates. The seven‑layer packaging protocol adds corrugated fiberboard and weather‑proof stretch film. Loaders use ratchet lashings and wheel chocks, and the cargo is monitored via live GPS to prevent sudden jolts.</p>
