        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All moves include an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covering up to the declared value of each item. Customers may opt for higher coverage limits for premium goods. The policy protects against loss, theft, and damage during transit, and claims are processed within 7 business days.</p>
