        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Two‑wheeler transport is quoted separately based on vehicle size, weight, and any disassembly required. Standard charges cover loading, secure hydraulic ramps, wheel chocks, and insurance. Extra fees may apply for oversized bikes, special handling requests, or if the vehicle must be moved over multiple floors without a lift.</p>
