        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical Packers And Movers Dewas To Surat move take and what factors affect timing?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard household shift averages 2 to 3 days: one day for packing, one for loading and transit, and a final day for unloading and placement. Factors influencing duration include traffic conditions on NH 19/NH 27/NH 48, weather, the number of staircases, and any additional services like furniture assembly.</p>
